#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:229
#: 0af12c79bf9146d79562758c48a7a70a
msgid ""
"Any failsafe (RC, Battery, GCS,etc.) will display a message and prevent "
"arming."
msgstr "任何失控保护（RC、电池、GCS 等）都会显示消息并阻止解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:233
#: 2045cb0f0da044928f939bc9df592434
msgid "Barometer failures:"
msgstr "气压计故障："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:235
#: d7b1b2003ea7478bb7ab5f80cb00d467
msgid ""
"**Baro not healthy** : the barometer sensor is reporting that it is "
"unhealthy which is normally a sign of a hardware failure."
msgstr "**Baro not healthy**：气压计传感器报告异常，通常表示硬件故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:238
#: 77e225b134e9402da4ffe8b5f97ab478
msgid ""
"**Alt disparity** : the barometer altitude disagrees with the inertial "
"navigation (i.e. Baro + Accelerometer) altitude estimate by more than 1 "
"meters.  This message is normally short-lived and can occur when the "
"autopilot is first plugged in or if it receives a hard jolt (i.e. dropped"
" suddenly).  If it does not clear the :ref:`accelerometers may need to be"
" calibrated <common-accelerometer-calibration>` or there may be a "
"barometer hardware issue."
msgstr ""
"**Alt disparity**：气压计高度与惯性导航（即气压计 + 加速度计）估算高度相差 1 "
"米以上。此消息通常短暂出现，可能在飞控刚接通电源或受到强烈冲击时出现。若持续存在，可能需要 :ref:`重新校准加速度计 <common-"
"accelerometer-calibration>`，或存在气压计硬件问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:246
#: 242ee1abd79a471b92b119438b953435
msgid "Compass failures:"
msgstr "罗盘故障："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:248
#: 8cb2d6eae2f448f583c966ebf6f0749b
msgid ""
"**Compass not healthy** : the compass sensor is reporting that it is "
"unhealthy which is a sign of a hardware failure."
msgstr "**Compass not healthy**：罗盘传感器报告异常，表示硬件故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:251
#: 4b9564cc9fe64c319146c90ea56b6419
msgid ""
"**Compass not calibrated** : the :ref:`compass(es) has not been "
"calibrated <common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>`.  the "
"``COMPASS_OFS_X, _Y, _Z`` parameters are zero or the number or type of "
"compasses connected has been changed since the last compass calibration "
"was performed."
msgstr ""
"**Compass not calibrated**：:ref:`罗盘尚未校准 <common-compass-calibration-in-"
"mission-planner>`。``COMPASS_OFS_X, _Y, _Z`` "
"参数为零，或自上次罗盘校准以来连接的罗盘数量或类型已发生变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:256
#: 6f0f156e7d034c9faa53e1cb3a2f1c8c
msgid ""
"**Compass offsets too high** : the primary compass's offsets length (i.e."
" sqrt(x^2+y^2+z^2)) are larger than 500.  This can be caused by metal "
"objects being placed too close to the compass.  If only an internal "
"compass is being used (not recommended), it may simply be the metal in "
"the board that is causing the large offsets and this may not actually be "
"a problem in which case you may wish to disable the compass check."
msgstr ""
"**Compass offsets too high**：主罗盘偏移量长度（即 sqrt(x^2+y^2+z^2)）大于 "
"500。这可能是由于金属物体距罗盘太近所致。如果只使用内置罗盘（不推荐），偏移量过大可能仅仅是电路板上的金属所致，这实际上可能不是问题，此时您可能希望禁用罗盘检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:264
#: 4c52bbc391a14452b0918d93165bc5cf
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Check mag field** : This can result from failing two different checks. "
"First, the sensed magnetic field in the area is 35% higher or  lower than"
" the expected value.  The expected length is 530 so it's > 874 or < 185. "
"Also, besides this rough check, when the vehicle's position has been "
"obtained (GPS lock), another check against the field strength predicted "
"using the internal World Magnetic Field database is done with much "
"tighter limits. If you are failing this, either the :ref:`compass "
"calibration <common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>` has not "
"calculated good offsets and calibration should be repeated, or your "
"vehicle is near a large metallic or magnetic disturbance and will need to"
" be relocated."
msgstr ""
"**Check mag field**：此问题可能由两种不同的检查失败引起。首先，传感器探测到的磁场强度比预期值高或低 35% 以上（预期长度为 "
"530，即 > 874 或 < 185）。此外，在获取飞行器位置（GPS "
"锁定）后，还会使用内置世界磁场数据库对磁场强度进行更严格的对比检查。如果此项检查失败，可能是 :ref:`罗盘校准 <common-"
"compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>` "
"计算的偏移量不佳需要重新校准，或飞行器附近存在大型金属或磁性干扰物需要移位。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:268
#: 393e51b1fc9a495da796afd2fa63236f
msgid ""
"**Compasses inconsistent** : the internal and external compasses are "
"pointing in different directions (off by >45 degrees).  This is normally "
"caused by the external compasses orientation (i.e. "
":ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>` parameter) being set incorrectly."
msgstr ""
"**Compasses inconsistent**：内部罗盘与外部罗盘指向不同方向（偏差 >45 度）。通常是因为外部罗盘的安装方向（即 "
":ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>` 参数）设置不正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:274
#: 2b55cc4c84d644fa9671a55cae7dbf56
msgid "GPS related failures:"
msgstr "GPS 相关故障："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:276
#: 44a9ad2ac0a541d3be435dea421d5b20
msgid ""
"**GPS Glitch** : the :ref:`GPS is glitching <gps-failsafe-glitch-"
"protection>` and the vehicle is in a flight mode that requires GPS (i.e. "
"Loiter, PosHold, etc) and/or the :ref:`cylindrical fence <common-"
"ac2_simple_geofence>` is enabled."
msgstr ""
"**GPS Glitch**：:ref:`GPS 信号异常 <gps-failsafe-glitch-protection>`，且飞行器处于需要 "
"GPS 的飞行模式（如 Loiter、PosHold 等），和/或已启用 :ref:`圆柱形电子围栏 <common-"
"ac2_simple_geofence>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:280
#: 9928bc93d7484a48abdf0f3c9db43db6
msgid ""
"**Need 3D Fix** : the GPS does not have a 3D fix and the vehicle is in a "
"flight mode that requires the GPS and/or the :ref:`cylindrical fence "
"<common-ac2_simple_geofence>` is enabled."
msgstr ""
"**Need 3D Fix**：GPS 未获得三维定位，且飞行器处于需要 GPS 的飞行模式，和/或已启用 :ref:`圆柱形电子围栏 "
"<common-ac2_simple_geofence>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:283
#: b7b741d4435d4ebbb429d71889d2b5c3
msgid ""
"**Bad Velocity** : the vehicle's velocity (according to inertial "
"navigation system) is above 50cm/s.  Issues that could lead to this "
"include the vehicle actually moving or being dropped, bad accelerometer "
"calibration, GPS updating at below the expected 5hz."
msgstr ""
"**Bad Velocity**：飞行器速度（由惯性导航系统计算）超过 50cm/s。可能原因包括飞行器实际移动或被抛动、加速度计校准不良、GPS"
" 更新频率低于预期的 5Hz。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:288
#: 2b340fc69435490fafda8d73425e8ad3
msgid ""
"**High GPS HDOP** : the GPS's HDOP value (a measure of the position "
"accuracy) is above 2.0 and the vehicle is in a flight mode that requires "
"GPS and/or the :ref:`cylindrical fence <common-ac2_simple_geofence>` is "
"enabled. This may be resolved by simply waiting a few minutes, moving to "
"a location with a better view of the sky or checking sources of GPS "
"interference (i.e. FPV equipment) are moved further from the GPS. "
"Alternatively the check can be relaxed by increasing the "
":ref:`GPS_HDOP_GOOD<GPS_HDOP_GOOD>` parameter to 2.2 or 2.5.  Worst case "
"the pilot may disable the fence and take-off in a mode that does not "
"require the GPS (i.e. Stabilize, AltHold) and switch into Loiter after "
"arming but this is not recommended."
msgstr ""
"**High GPS HDOP**：GPS 的 HDOP 值（位置精度的衡量指标）超过 2.0，且飞行器处于需要 GPS 的飞行模式，和/或已启用"
" :ref:`圆柱形电子围栏 <common-ac2_simple_geofence>`。可以尝试等待几分钟、移至视野更开阔的地点，或将 FPV "
"设备等 GPS 干扰源移至更远处来解决。也可以将 :ref:`GPS_HDOP_GOOD<GPS_HDOP_GOOD>` 参数增至 2.2 或 "
"2.5 来放宽限制。最坏的情况下，飞手可以禁用电子围栏并在不需要 GPS 的模式（如 "
"Stabilize、AltHold）下解锁起飞，解锁后再切换至 Loiter，但不推荐这样做。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:300
#: 4fed9a790bff4e738235684c74e242ef
msgid ""
"Note: the GPS HDOP can be readily viewed through the Mission Planner's "
"Quick tab as shown below."
msgstr "注意：GPS HDOP 值可在 Mission Planner 的「Quick」选项卡中直接查看，如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:307
#: a5ad473d3bdd436585354242a4f314e2
msgid "INS checks (i.e. Acclerometer and Gyro checks):"
msgstr "INS 检查（即加速度计和陀螺仪检查）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:309
#: 5ee8bbe62c5c40d390b2cf601928f4c7
msgid ""
"**INS not calibrated**: some or all of the accelerometer's offsets are "
"zero.  The :ref:`accelerometers need to be calibrated <common-"
"accelerometer-calibration>`."
msgstr ""
"**INS not calibrated**：部分或全部加速度计偏移量为零。需要 :ref:`校准加速度计 <common-"
"accelerometer-calibration>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:312
#: cf4c67c46a5042c5813cf9b6e02e7e66
msgid ""
"**Accels not healthy**: one of the accelerometers is reporting it is not "
"healthy which could be a hardware issue.  This can also occur immediately"
" after a firmware update before the board has been restarted."
msgstr "**Accels not healthy**：某个加速度计报告状态不正常，可能是硬件问题。也可能在固件更新后、重启飞控板之前出现。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:316
#: e508244e36e14435aac8f02fab6fd3c7
msgid ""
"**Accels inconsistent**: the accelerometers are reporting accelerations "
"which are different by at least 1m/s/s.  The :ref:`accelerometers need to"
" be re-calibrated <common-accelerometer-calibration>` or there is a "
"hardware issue."
msgstr ""
"**Accels inconsistent**：各加速度计测量的加速度差异达到至少 1m/s/s。需要 :ref:`重新校准加速度计 "
"<common-accelerometer-calibration>`，或存在硬件问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:320
#: 9d11fdb4ef5540dc9b1963737b4c647d
msgid ""
"**Gyros not healthy**: one of the gyroscopes is reporting it is unhealthy"
" which is likely a hardware issue.  This can also occur immediately after"
" a firmware update before the board has been restarted."
msgstr "**Gyros not healthy**：某个陀螺仪报告状态不正常，可能是硬件问题。也可能在固件更新后、重启飞控板之前出现。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:324
#: 51c4644c751c4719b7cc440ba87a785e
msgid ""
"**Gyro cal failed**: the gyro calibration failed to capture offsets. This"
" is most often caused by the vehicle being moved during the gyro "
"calibration (when red and blue lights are flashing) in which case "
"unplugging the battery and plugging it in again while being careful not "
"to jostle the vehicle will likely resolve the issue.  Sensors hardware "
"failures (i.e. spikes) can also cause this failure."
msgstr ""
"**Gyro cal "
"failed**：陀螺仪校准未能采集偏移量。最常见原因是在陀螺仪校准期间（红蓝灯闪烁时）飞行器被移动，此时拔出电池重新插入（注意不要晃动飞行器）通常可以解决问题。传感器硬件故障（如信号尖刺）也可能导致此故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:331
#: 40eb327a9626456d9599a1cf2474a3cb
msgid ""
"**Gyros inconsistent**: two gyroscopes are reporting vehicle rotation "
"rates that differ by more than 20deg/sec.  This is likely a hardware "
"failure or caused by a bad gyro calibration."
msgstr "**Gyros inconsistent**：两个陀螺仪测量的飞行器旋转速率相差超过 20deg/sec。可能是硬件故障或陀螺仪校准不良。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:336
#: 44ed11fb9f254ed29579ef1d98475145
msgid "Board Voltage checks:"
msgstr "主板电压检查："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:338
#: 2fff90d083b04b6487de8622e3e05815
msgid ""
"**Check Board Voltage**: the board's internal voltage is below 4.3 Volts "
"or above 5.8 Volts."
msgstr "**Check Board Voltage**：主板内部电压低于 4.3V 或高于 5.8V。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:341
#: 04913ec599e6437a9e4a9791cc54c578
msgid ""
"If powered through a USB cable (i.e. while on the bench) this can be "
"caused by the desktop computer being unable to provide sufficient current"
" to the autopilot - try replacing the USB cable."
msgstr "如果通过 USB 线供电（如在桌面测试时），可能是计算机无法为飞控提供足够的电流——请尝试更换 USB 线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:345
#: 477a4e3b4db34cfca04e4a9afb3a895f
msgid ""
"If powered from a battery this is a serious problem and the power system "
"(i.e. Power Module, battery, etc) should be carefully checked before "
"flying."
msgstr "如果通过电池供电，则属于严重问题，应在飞行前仔细检查供电系统（电源模块、电池等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:350
#: 386145a9602f469299ef1a73f8601be5
msgid "Parameter checks:"
msgstr "参数检查："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:352
#: 3e9b1b6afa3f49aa9079b62152c09aef
msgid ""
"**Ch7&Ch8 Opt cannot be same**: :ref:`Auxiliary Function Switches "
"<channel-7-and-8-options>` are set to the same option which is not "
"permitted because it could lead to confusion."
msgstr ""
"**Ch7&Ch8 Opt cannot be same**：:ref:`辅助功能开关 <channel-7-and-8-options>` "
"被设置为相同选项，这是不允许的，因为可能导致混乱。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:354
#: 6dc4218d592c412da6f7ed8128ea5292
msgid ""
"**Check FS_THR_VALUE**: the :ref:`radio failsafe pwm value <radio-"
"failsafe>` has been set too close to the throttle channels (i.e. ch3) "
"minimum."
msgstr ""
"**Check FS_THR_VALUE**：:ref:`遥控失控保护 PWM 值 <radio-failsafe>` "
"与油门通道（ch3）最小值设置过于接近。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:356
#: 6599fa3429f44eb18f3e1247002f8f33
msgid ""
"**Check ANGLE_MAX**: the :ref:`ANGLE_MAX<ANGLE_MAX>` parameter which "
"controls the vehicle's maximum lean angle has been set below 10 degrees "
"(i.e. 1000) or above 80 degrees (i.e. 8000)."
msgstr ""
"**Check ANGLE_MAX**：控制飞行器最大倾斜角度的 :ref:`ANGLE_MAX<ANGLE_MAX>` 参数被设置为低于 10 "
"度（即 1000）或高于 80 度（即 8000）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:360
#: 17275878d36b4196879596d358a8212d
msgid ""
"**ACRO_BAL_ROLL/PITCH**: the :ref:`ACRO_BAL_ROLL<ACRO_BAL_ROLL>` "
"parameter is higher than the Stabilize Roll P and/or "
":ref:`ACRO_BAL_PITCH<ACRO_BAL_PITCH>` parameter is higher than the "
"Stabilize Pitch P value.  This could lead to the pilot being unable to "
"control the lean angle in ACRO mode because the :ref:`Acro Trainer "
"stabilization <acro-mode_acro_trainer>` would overpower the pilot's "
"input."
msgstr ""
"**ACRO_BAL_ROLL/PITCH**：:ref:`ACRO_BAL_ROLL<ACRO_BAL_ROLL>` 参数高于 "
"Stabilize 横滚 P 值，和/或 :ref:`ACRO_BAL_PITCH<ACRO_BAL_PITCH>` 参数高于 Stabilize"
" 俯仰 P 值。这可能导致飞手在 Acro 模式下无法控制倾斜角度，因为 :ref:`Acro Trainer 稳定 <acro-"
"mode_acro_trainer>` 功能会覆盖飞手输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:367
#: 8a6e4efdbe3b40a7952ed7d0a7f2fd04
msgid "Battery/Power Monitor:"
msgstr "电池/电源监测器："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:369
#: 11a630c6d94f483eb5bc2e94135b2670
msgid ""
"If a power monitor voltage is below its failsafe low or critical voltages"
" or failsafe remaining capacity low or critical set points, this check "
"will fail and indicate which set point it is below. It will also fail if "
"these set points are inverted, ie critical point is higher than low "
"point. See :ref:`failsafe-battery` for Copter, :ref:`apms-failsafe-"
"function` for Plane, or :ref:`rover-failsafes` for Rover for more "
"information on these."
msgstr ""
"如果电源监测器电压低于其失控保护低电压或临界电压，或剩余容量低于失控保护低容量或临界容量设定值，此检查将失败并提示超出的设定点。若这些设定点顺序颠倒（即临界值高于低值），也会失败。详见"
" Copter 的 :ref:`failsafe-battery`、Plane 的 :ref:`apms-failsafe-function` 或"
" Rover 的 :ref:`rover-failsafes`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:371
#: 75024eec85c54d8ebf21ebc84a73f53c
msgid ""
"In addition, minimum arming voltage and remaining capacity parameters for"
" each battery/power monitor can be set, for example "
":ref:`BATT_ARM_VOLT<BATT_ARM_VOLT>` and :ref:`BATT_ARM_MAH<BATT_ARM_MAH>`"
" for the first battery, to provide a check that the battery is not only "
"above failsafe levels, but also has enough capacity for operation."
msgstr ""
"此外，可为每个电池/电源监测器设置最低解锁电压和剩余容量参数（例如第一块电池的 "
":ref:`BATT_ARM_VOLT<BATT_ARM_VOLT>` 和 "
":ref:`BATT_ARM_MAH<BATT_ARM_MAH>`），以确保电池不仅超过失控保护水平，还有足够的飞行容量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:374
#: 757476eee138483096778e207b5544f3
msgid "Airspeed:"
msgstr "空速："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:376
#: a617d1f1853c4701a34866153e8b43d2
msgid ""
"If an airspeed sensor is configured, and it is not providing a reading or"
" failed to calibrate, this check will fail."
msgstr "如果已配置空速传感器但未提供读数或校准失败，此检查将失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:378
#: 6031a3d2b7ad484aa4009e2a43e49680
msgid "**Airspeed not healthy**"
msgstr "**Airspeed not healthy**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:381
#: df1e6d240fb6435b9507936c1e3c5024
msgid "Logging:"
msgstr "日志记录："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:383
#: 11b67ce87c1d465a8c17e08f2f80e8d6
msgid ""
"**Logging failed**: Logging pre-armed was enabled but failed to write to "
"the log."
msgstr "**Logging failed**：已启用解锁前日志记录，但写入日志失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:385
#: 26438e7399b04ee7b72862b19672e04d
msgid "**No SD Card**: Logging is enabled, but no SD card is detected."
msgstr "**No SD Card**：已启用日志记录，但未检测到 SD 卡。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:388
#: ffd6015db3c44d78a64bfe831eb26ea9
msgid "Safety Switch:"
msgstr "安全开关："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:390
#: e7eb45ef55c542089f0cc9d36ea32b17
msgid "**Hardware safety switch**: Hardware safety switch has not been pushed."
msgstr "**Hardware safety switch**：硬件安全开关未被按下。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:393
#: c27d6799fbc44aab809aa68baadb7b8f
msgid "System:"
msgstr "系统："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:395
#: 7d810b79fa8d464f99b7d81830a519bc
msgid ""
"**Param storage failed**: A check of reading the parameter storage area "
"failed."
msgstr "**Param storage failed**：读取参数存储区域的检查失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:397
#: 4e82e61b2422421cbd38f903f1d1b7a5
msgid ""
"**Internal errors (0xx)**: An internal error has occurred. Report to "
"ArduPilot development team `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/15916>`_"
msgstr ""
"**Internal errors (0xx)**：发生了内部错误。请在 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/15916>`_ 向 ArduPilot "
"开发团队报告。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:399
#: 9211d2cf604b4d6289e169b9a960ee96
msgid "**KDECAN Failed**: KDECAN system failure."
msgstr "**KDECAN Failed**：KDECAN 系统故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:401
#: c8059dc54364437980c031a795aaa234
msgid "**DroneCAN Failed**: DroneCAN system failure."
msgstr "**DroneCAN Failed**：DroneCAN 系统故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:404
#: 5de28b43ad7b4e1f8528f0974aa10773
msgid "Mission:"
msgstr "任务："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:406
#: 76e5fcea93e04b8fbe6f75c5813afe54
msgid "See :ref:`ARMING_MIS_ITEMS<ARMING_MIS_ITEMS>`"
msgstr "See :ref:`ARMING_MIS_ITEMS<ARMING_MIS_ITEMS>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:408
#: b49f551d7152467f94c0883c0dcdd044
msgid ""
"**No mission library present**: Mission checking is enabled, but no "
"mission is loaded."
msgstr "**No mission library present**：已启用任务检查，但未加载任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:410
#: a4656945d6fa4d2892faf7ff2f78fc19
msgid ""
"**No rally library present**: Rally point checking is enabled, but no "
"rally points loaded."
msgstr "**No rally library present**：已启用集结点检查，但未加载集结点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:412
#: 65f4c3f7a8224d7ebb7ca35b5e1cb272
msgid "**Missing mission item: xxxx**: A required mission items is missing."
msgstr "**Missing mission item: xxxx**：缺少必要的任务项目。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:416
#: 51dc2cf960544cca9f060e27df9b7509
msgid "Rangefinder:"
msgstr "测距仪："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:418
#: 96fbcf27bd924c26b65a6d2fe1ca2e63
msgid "IF a rangefinder has been configured, a reporting error has occurred."
msgstr "如果已配置测距仪，则发生了报告错误。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:421
#: 0264ed76194349ab8fd17cb443f595e1
msgid "Disabling the Pre-arm Safety Check"
msgstr "禁用解锁前安全检查"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:423
#: 7173640c8a544f8b9984f9267eaef97e
msgid ""
"Disabling pre-arm safety checks is not recommended. The cause of the pre-"
"arm failure should be corrected before operation of the vehicle if at all"
" possible. If you are confident that the pre-arm check failure is not a "
"real problem, it is possible to disable a failing check."
msgstr "不建议禁用解锁前安全检查。如果可能，应在飞行前纠正导致检查失败的原因。如果您确信某项检查失败并不是真正的问题，可以禁用该项检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:425
#: cf9ece1d45a4406bba4aca8086a911f0
msgid ""
"Arming checks can be individually disabled by setting the "
":ref:`ARMING_CHECK<ARMING_CHECK>` parameter to something other than 1. "
"Setting to 0 completely removes all pre-arm checks. For example, setting "
"to  4 only checks that the GPS has lock."
msgstr ""
"可以通过将 :ref:`ARMING_CHECK<ARMING_CHECK>` 参数设置为非 1 的值来单独禁用各项解锁检查。设为 0 "
"则完全取消所有解锁前检查。例如，设为 4 则只检查 GPS 是否已锁定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:427
#: 8cc6bcee6d974182b80b16e79b2732a4
msgid "This can also be configured using Mission Planner:"
msgstr "也可以通过 Mission Planner 进行配置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:433
#: f92d7e85f5d146bbaf09ba8d5547eda0
msgid "Connecting your Autopilot to the Mission Planner"
msgstr "将飞控连接到 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:434
#: dbcdf519851e466facc6f2661085d9f3
msgid "Go to Mission Planner's Config/Tuning >> Standard Params screen"
msgstr "进入 Mission Planner 的 Config/Tuning >> Standard Params 界面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:435
#: 463261f3667d4aa3b68f6524555c573c
msgid ""
"set the Arming Check drop-down to \"Disabled\" or one of the \"Skip\" "
"options which more effectively skips the item causing the failure."
msgstr "将解锁检查（Arming Check）下拉菜单设置为 'Disabled' 或某个 'Skip' 选项，以更有效地跳过导致失败的项目。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:437
#: a036b45548944e0fb1611e1f70064366
msgid "Push the \"Write Params\" button"
msgstr "点击 'Write Params' 按钮"

